 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontier Tale</strong> is a cozy adventure farming game where <strong>extraction-style expeditions</strong> fuel the growth of your settlement. As a pioneer, you'll venture into the wilderness alongside your loyal maid, Mia, to gather resources, build a thriving village, recruit unique companions, and explore procedurally generated maps. Every expedition brings you one step closer to creating a prosperous frontier that's truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/341dc1a332f9d03380b29463ddf39ac7.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/341dc1a332f9d03380b29463ddf39ac7.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/341dc1a332f9d03380b29463ddf39ac7.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【GAME FEATURES】</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Expedition Is a New Adventure</strong><br>No two expeditions are ever the same. Explore procedurally generated maps filled with unexpected encounters, dangerous monsters, hidden treasures, and valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with weapons you've forged yourself, decide how much you're willing to risk, and make the crucial choice between pushing deeper for greater rewards or extracting safely before losing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/c97e46232b7e70595549bbc6a357400b.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/c97e46232b7e70595549bbc6a357400b.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/c97e46232b7e70595549bbc6a357400b.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build the Village of Your Dreams</strong><br>Turn the resources you recover into a flourishing frontier settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct workshops, warehouses, farms, and production facilities to process materials, craft equipment, brew drinks, and prepare for future expeditions. As your village grows, your companions will live, work, and breathe life back into the forgotten land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/64395dfc2f7ddb1d13a06c0337b20040.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/64395dfc2f7ddb1d13a06c0337b20040.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/64395dfc2f7ddb1d13a06c0337b20040.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Unforgettable Companions</strong><br>As your territory expands, you’ll encounter a group of wild and wonderful companions: a mercenary girl who fears rabbits, a mysterious carpenter with a hidden past, a knight with a unique obsession with combat... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit these companions, each with their own combat style and work specialties. They won’t just join you on adventures — they’ll also become your trusted helpers in the village, taking care of farming, watering crops, animal husbandry, gathering, and other important tasks as you work together to build your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Charming Cel-Shaded Fantasy World</strong><br>Don't let the colorful visuals fool you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the storybook-inspired cel-shaded art style lies a wilderness full of danger, mystery, and unexpected challenges. Every peaceful landscape may hide a deadly surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/de48cf836c9eaeb27588407411677193.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/de48cf836c9eaeb27588407411677193.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/de48cf836c9eaeb27588407411677193.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Secrets of a Lost Civilization</strong><br>Why did a once-prosperous land where humans and monsters lived together fall into ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover ancient documents, restore forgotten relics, and gradually piece together the truth behind the lost civilization as you venture deeper into the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/4632c6134262843b34858e184d6497f8.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/4632c6134262843b34858e184d6497f8.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/4632c6134262843b34858e184d6497f8.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the adventure to your own pace.Whether you're looking for a relaxing exploration experience or a high-stakes extraction challenge, multiple difficulty options let you customize the level of risk and reward.There's always one more run waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/44aa84189382c58cdbcc1c642273bb4e.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/44aa84189382c58cdbcc1c642273bb4e.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/44aa84189382c58cdbcc1c642273bb4e.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
